  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento de la Gestin Financiera II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Public Finance Management II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos especficos de esta serie programtica son: (i) incrementar los ingresos tributarios y aduaneros; (ii) mejorar la relacin entre la Direccin General de Impuestos y los contribuyentes y reducir los costos de transaccin mediante un nuevo cdigo impositivo; (iii) reducir los costos de recaudacin; (iv) reasignar el gasto publico; (v) mejorar la gerencia de los recursos humanos y el gasto en personal; (vi) incrementar la inversin publica; y (vii) mejorar la transparencia fiscal.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The specific objectives of the programmatic series are to: (i) increase both internal tax and customs revenues; (ii) improve the relation between the Internal Revenue Office (DGI) and taxpayers and reduce transaction cost through a new tax code; (iii) reduce in tax collection costs; (iv) reallocate public spending to poverty reduction activities; (v) improve management of human resources and personnel expenditures; (vi) increase public investments; and (vii) improve overall fiscal transparency.</narrative>
  </description>
